# Runner supplies an isolated sealed Keeper and a deliberately corrupt session
# file. No test backend or pretend save result is injected.
settle 90
ui-zoom 1
assert snap practice-saved == false
assert snap practice-save-problem == true
act p6-mixed-set-example
settle 5
assert snap set-cards == 3
act preservation-request-close
settle 4
assert snap p6-close-pending == true
assert text Practice is not confirmed saved
capture 01_close_keeps_quarantined_work
click .practice-close-retry
settle 4
assert snap p6-close-pending == true
assert snap set-cards == 3
capture 02_close_retry_retains_work
click .practice-close-cancel
settle 4
assert snap p6-close-pending == false
assert snap set-cards == 3
capture 03_close_cancel_retains_work
act preservation-request-close
settle 4
assert snap p6-close-pending == true
capture 04_explicit_close_decision
# Frame completion now reaches the same preservation guard and leaves this
# window open. The coordinator must visibly choose Discard to exit this owned
# fixture, then verify that its original corrupt bytes remain unchanged.
log Quarantined practice retained pending explicit native discard
